    {
      "id": "r20261111-a01",
      "title": "The Big Family Photo",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "Every five years, the Wijaya family takes a big family photo. This year, twenty people came to Grandmother’s house in Solo.",
        "The photographer put the tall people at the back and the children at the front. But where was Great-Grandmother? Everyone looked for her. She was in the kitchen, making her famous fried bananas!",
        "\"The photo can wait. The bananas cannot,\" she said with a laugh. So the whole family ate warm fried bananas first. Then, with happy faces and sweet fingers, they took the best family photo ever."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "photographer": "juru foto",
        "back": "belakang",
        "front": "depan",
        "looked for": "mencari",
        "famous": "terkenal",
        "fingers": "jari"
      },
