    {
      "id": "r20261111-a02",
      "title": "The Rise of Second-Hand Shopping",
      "level": "Menengah",
      "min": 3,
      "body": [
        "Ten years ago, buying second-hand clothes was something people hid. Today, it is a trend. Thrift shops are opening in every city, and online markets for used goods are growing fast.",
        "The reasons are practical. Second-hand items cost half the price or less. But many young shoppers also talk about the environment. Every used jacket that finds a new owner is one less jacket in a landfill, and one less that a factory needs to make.",
        "The trend has even changed how people see gifts. A vintage bag with a story can be more special than a new one. \"Fast fashion made us buy without thinking,\" says one shop owner. \"Second-hand shopping makes every piece mean something.\""
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "second-hand": "bekas",
        "thrift shops": "toko barang bekas",
        "used": "bekas",
        "environment": "lingkungan",
        "landfill": "tempat pembuangan akhir",
        "vintage": "barang kuno berkualitas",
        "mean": "berarti"
      },
